    <string name="ui_choose_play_instant_action_select_a_map_an_2c16c" formatted="false">Choose Play → Instant Action, select a map and press Deploy. Enable controls at the top left after spawning. Move with the left stick and look using the right area, or hold and drag Fire. Customize button positions in Options. Switch between ON FOOT and VEHICLE at the top. Vehicles use steering arrows, throttle and brake; the right area controls the camera, turret or flight. S1–S7 select seats. COUNTERMEASURES only works on supported vehicles.</string>
    <string name="ui_left_thumb_movement_right_area_look_hold_a_0ef50" formatted="false">Left thumb: movement. Right area: look. Hold and drag Fire to look while shooting. In vehicle mode, drag throttle/brake without releasing, or slide between steering arrows. Loadout opens weapon selection. All held inputs are released when switching to menus.</string>
