    <string name="ui_hardware_help_title">Gamepad, keyboard and mouse</string>
    <string name="ui_hardware_help">Keyboard: WASD, mouse look, left/right mouse fire/aim, R reload, Space jump, Ctrl crouch, Shift sprint, F use, Enter loadout, 1–5 equipment. Mouse wheel cycles equipment.\n\nF12 or gamepad Select switches between game controls and menus. In menus, the left stick or D-pad moves the cursor and A selects.\n\nGamepad: left stick moves, right stick looks, RT fires, LT aims, A jumps, B crouches, X reloads, Y opens loadout, L3 sprints, R3 uses. LB/RB cycles equipment. D-pad: up map, down prone, left/right lean. Start or Escape opens pause.\n\nUSB and Bluetooth devices use Android input support. Controls held when focus is lost or a device disconnects are released.</string>
